 "version": "1.7.9",
 "changelog": "Scanning is much faster now. The app keeps looking at the screen in short quick checks, so a button is seen almost as soon as it appears, even after long quiet scanning. If a button moves away or vanishes in the middle of a hold, the app lets go at once and looks for it at its new place instead of pressing empty space. Right before a press the app takes one fresh look to be sure the button is still there. Zoomii got polish too: you can set her floating size in Settings, her dance is short now, she naps after 15 quiet seconds, her clip edges are clean with no dark fringe, dragging her is smooth, she gently sticks to a screen side when you drop her near it, the little word badge under her is gone, and she now shows an angry reaction when a button escapes. The panel no longer moves her when it opens.",
